rem 3. Your own functions
use sequences
use numbers

rem Define an operation once, then call it after its data.
fun twice Value
  return Value * 2
end
rem With one number the result is 42.
21 twice
rem The same function works on an array: 2 4 6 8 10.
1 to 5 twice

rem A function can choose a result with if and else.
fun ticket Age
  if Age less 12
    return 5
  else
    return 10
  end
end
rem A child's ticket costs 5; an adult's costs 10.
8 ticket
20 ticket

rem Try changing the age limit or the multiplier in twice.
